| Field | Record |
| --- | --- |
| Audit base | origin/main=5984251d03c1d3f5ad40e39baa4d66ae08780ea4, tree 249a149a9c2702d2b11fd2b7dfa5828d03380ce3, state 2026-10-07.audit.110; Target C C-II open |
