| Field | Record |
| --- | --- |
| Audit base | `origin/main=468d06ae695ea012de73a5a8919e034c424ecd9e`, tree `c2d77ee2a78bcaaf1412dbc0d767ce5eaba46b4d`, state `2026-10-07.audit.111`; Target C C-II open |
