| Verdict and canonical disposition | **PASS — promote `C-ATOMIC-TRACK-BOUNDARY-COST`.** Theorem A survives. The source report remains unreviewed as a whole; the finite verifier is not registered as a theorem certificate because it does not prove the weak-limit arguments. Audit.130 separately audits Theorem B. |
