### Refreshed field and frozen source

- Audit base: `origin/main=78343286a9d2176308d8b1787c00cc24e9ce6f91`, state `2026-10-08.audit.151`. During this audit, ledger-only PR #843 merged as `50ee4761dd8cdc04f93357d21f18ddadfdcff1e5`; theorem state remained audit.151, and the audit branch was rebased to that tip.
